I walk over to the big supermarket.
It is much bigger than the shop on the corner.
It is bright here, and there are many people.
I want to take a shopping cart.
But the carts are locked.
I need a coin.
I search in my pocket.
Luckily, I find a ten-krone coin.
I put the coin in the cart.
Now the shopping cart is free.
I walk into the supermarket.
There are so many shelves here!
There is food everywhere.
There are really many things here.
Where should I start?
